    "answer": "because/the-reason-is/if-you-want-to-know-why",
    "mnemonic": "When someone asks you <ja>何故</ja>, or \"why,\" you did something, you respond with, \"<ja>何故なら</ja> blah blah blah.\" That makes it mean <vocabulary>because</vocabulary>. Why did you do that? Because I was mad! Why did you dance? Because I was happy!",
